{"seq":5,"slug":"synthesizer-principles","title":"合成器原理","stage":"DONE","category":"music-audio","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 合成器原理\n\n合成器是通过电子或数字手段生成和塑造声音的乐器，其核心能力在于从零开始构建音色——不受物理乐器固有共鸣体的限制。从 1960 年代 Moog 模块化合成器到今天的软件合成器，合成技术经历了半个多世纪的演进，但底层原理始终围绕三个核心问题展开：如何生成原始波形、如何塑造频谱特征、如何让声音随时间演化。\n\n本 Hub 系统讲解合成器的工作原理和音色设计方法。从合成方法论的比较开始——减法合成、FM 合成、波表合成、粒子合成各有什么本质区别和擅长领域；然后深入振荡器与滤波器的技术细节——波形的数学构造、滤波器的频率响应特性和包络的时间塑形；接着探讨调制系统——LFO、包络和调制矩阵如何赋予静态参数以运动和生命；最终进入实践层面——如何运用这些原理设计出从经典模拟音色到前卫实验声音的各种音色。\n\n理解合成器原理不仅服务于音色设计，更帮助理解所有电子音乐的声音构成逻辑。当你知道一个 Pad 音色是由什么波形经过什么滤波和调制产生的，你就能在混音中更精确地处理它、在编曲中更有效地使用它。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synthesis-methods","title":"合成方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/synthesis-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"subtractive-synthesis","title":"减法合成与模拟合成器架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/synthesis-methods/subtractive-synthesis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fm-synthesis","title":"FM 合成与频率调制原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/synthesis-methods/fm-synthesis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wavetable-granular","title":"波表合成与粒子合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/synthesis-methods/wavetable-granular"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"oscillators-filters","title":"振荡器与滤波器","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"oscillator-waveforms","title":"振荡器波形生成与抗混叠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/oscillator-waveforms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"filter-types","title":"滤波器类型与共振特性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/filter-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"envelope-adsr","title":"ADSR 包络与时间塑形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/envelope-adsr"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"modulation-routing","title":"调制与路由系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lfo-modulation","title":"LFO 与周期调制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/lfo-modulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mod-matrix","title":"调制矩阵与路由架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/mod-matrix"},{"seq":3,"slug":"midi-expression","title":"MIDI 控制与表达映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/midi-expression"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sound-design-practice","title":"音色设计实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"design-workflow","title":"音色设计工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/design-workflow"},{"seq":2,"slug":"classic-patches","title":"经典音色复现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/classic-patches"},{"seq":3,"slug":"creative-design","title":"创意音色设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/sound-design-practice/creative-design"}]}]}